msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Days to Close`: Imkoniyat yopilishi uchun qancha kun ketganini "
"o'lchaydi. Yopilgan imkoniyatlar *Yutilgan* deb belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/performance/win_loss.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days To Convert`: Measures the number of days it took an "
