"ma'lumotlar bazasi administratori tomonidan berilgan ruxsatga bog'liq. "
"Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`kirish huquqlari <../../../general/users/"
"access_rights>` hujjatiga qarang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:None
msgid "An opportunity's page as viewed within the user portal."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi portalida ko'ringan imkoniyat sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/resellers.rst:183
msgid ":doc:`../../../general/users/user_portals`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../general/users/user_portals`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:3
msgid "Unattended leads report"
msgstr "E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisoboti"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Unattended leads* are leads that have scheduled activities that are either "
"due or past due. Whenever an activity is scheduled, Odoo tracks the due "
"date, and sends email reminders to the users the activity is assigned to."
msgstr ""
"*E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar* — bu muddati kelgan yoki muddati o'tgan "
"rejalashtirilgan faoliyatlarga ega lidlar. Faoliyat rejalashtirilganda, Odoo "
"tugash sanasini kuzatadi va faoliyat tayinlangan foydalanuvchilarga email "
"eslatmalarini yuboradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:9
msgid ""
"An *unattended leads report* compiles all active leads in the pipeline with "
"due or past due activities, allowing a sales manager to identify which "
"opportunities require immediate attention."
msgstr ""
"*E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisoboti* pipeline'dagi (voronkadagi) muddati "
"kelgan yoki muddati o'tgan faoliyatlarga ega barcha faol lidlarni jamlaydi "
"va sotuv menejeriga qaysi imkoniyatlar zudlik bilan e'tibor talab qilishini "
"aniqlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:12
msgid ""
"By pulling a daily unattended leads report, sales managers can remind their "
"teams to address outstanding activities before they become past due, helping "
"avoid neglected leads and reinforcing proactive behaviors in their "
"salespeople."
msgstr ""
"Kunlik e'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisobotini olish orqali sotuv menejerlari "
"o'z jamoalariga bajarilmagan faoliyatlarni muddati o'tib ketishidan oldin "
"hal qilishni eslatishlari mumkin, bu esa lidlarning e'tiborsiz qolishining "
"oldini oladi va sotuvchilarda proaktiv xatti-harakatlarni mustahkamlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:18
msgid ""
"A sales manager starts their day by pulling an unattended leads report, and "
"upon switching to list view, they see the following:"
msgstr ""
"Sotuv menejeri o'z kunini e'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisobotini olishdan "
"boshlaydi va ro'yxat ko'rinishiga o'tgach, quyidagilarni ko'radi:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:0
msgid ""
"List view of a sample Unattended Leads report with the activities emphasized."
msgstr ""
"Faoliyatlar ajratib ko'rsatilgan namunaviy e'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar "
"hisobotining ro'yxat ko'rinishi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:25
msgid ""
"Their team member, Mitchell, has two leads in the *Proposition* stage with "
"activities that are due."
msgstr ""
"Ularning jamoa a'zosi Mitchellda *Proposition* bosqichida muddati kelgan "
"faoliyatlarga ega ikkita lid bor."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:28
msgid ""
"The yellow :guilabel:`📞 (phone)` icon indicates that the `Modern Open "
"Space` lead has a phone call activity scheduled for today. The "
"red :guilabel:`✉️ (envelope)` icon indicates that the `5 VP Chairs` lead has "
"an email activity scheduled that is past due."
msgstr ""
"Sariq :guilabel:`📞 (phone)` belgisi `Modern Open Space` lidida bugunga "
"rejalashtirilgan telefon qo'ng'irog'i faoliyati borligini bildiradi. "
"Qizil :guilabel:`✉️ (envelope)` belgisi `5 VP Chairs` lidida muddati o'tib "
"ketgan elektron pochta faoliyati rejalashtirilganligini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:32
msgid ""
"Clicking on the `5 VP Chairs` lead, the sales manager opens the record of "
"the lead and reviews the chatter. They see that the email was scheduled to "
"be sent two days ago, but Mitchell never marked this activity as done."
msgstr ""
"`5 VP Chairs` lidini bosib, sotuv menejeri lid yozuvini ochadi va chatterni "
"ko'rib chiqadi. Ular elektron pochta ikki kun oldin yuborilishi "
"rejalashtirilganini, ammo Mitchell bu faoliyatni hech qachon bajarilgan deb "
"belgilamaganini ko'radilar."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:0
#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:None
msgid "Example of overdue activities notification in the chatter of a lead."
msgstr "Lid chatterida muddati o'tgan faoliyatlar bildirishnomasi namunasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:41
msgid ""
"In order to pull a unattended leads report, sales teams **must** be "
"regularly utilizing activity in the *CRM* pipeline, on individual lead and "
"opportunity cards."
msgstr ""
"E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisobotini olish uchun sotuv jamoalari *CRM* "
"pipeline'ida, alohida lid va imkoniyat kartalarida faoliyatdan muntazam "
"foydalanishlari **shart**."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:44
msgid ""
"It is **not** possible to compile a complete report if the sales people are "
"not using the *Activities* feature in the *chatter*"
msgstr ""
"Agar sotuvchilar *chatter*dagi *Activities* funksiyasidan foydalanmasalar, "
"to'liq hisobot tuzish mumkin **emas**"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:47
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to :doc:`Activities <../../../essentials/"
"activities>`"
msgstr ""
"Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`Faoliyatlar <../../../essentials/activities>` "
"bo'limiga qarang"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:50
msgid "Create an unattended leads report"
msgstr "E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisobotini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:52
msgid ""
"To create an unattended leads report, first navigate to :menuselection:`CRM "
"app --> Reporting --> Pipeline` to open the :guilabel:`Pipeline Analysis` "
"dashboard. Click into the :guilabel:`Search...` bar at the top of the page, "
"and remove all of the default filters."
msgstr ""
"E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisobotini yaratish uchun avval :guilabel:`Pipeline "
"Analysis` boshqaruv panelini ochish uchun :menuselection:`CRM app --> "
"Reporting --> Pipeline` yo'lidan o'ting. Sahifaning yuqori "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Search...` panelini bosing va barcha standart "
"filtrlarni olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:57
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Created on` filter can remain active, as this variable may be "
"useful to include in the report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Created on` filtri faol qolishi mumkin, chunki bu o'zgaruvchini "
"hisobotga kiritish foydali bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:60
msgid ""
"Next, add custom filters by clicking the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed "
"down)` icon to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open the drop-"
"down menu that contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` columns. Under the :guilabel:`Filters` column, "
"click :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter`, which opens an :guilabel:`Add Custom "
"Filter` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By` va :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"ustunlarini o'z ichiga olgan ochiluvchi menyuni ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Search...` panelining o'ng "
"tomonidagi :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed down)` belgisini bosib, maxsus "
"filtrlar qo'shing. :guilabel:`Filters` ustuni ostida :guilabel:`Add Custom "
"Filter` tugmasini bosing, bu :guilabel:`Add Custom Filter` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:70
msgid ""
"In order to generate an unattended leads report, filters need to be created "
"for the following conditions:"
msgstr ""
"E'tiborsiz qolgan lidlar hisobotini yaratish uchun quyidagi shartlar "
"bo'yicha filtrlar yaratilishi kerak:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:73
msgid ""
":ref:`Past due activities <unattended_leads_report/past-due>`: limits the "
"results to only include leads with an assigned activity where the due date "
"has past. This can be altered to include activities due to occur on the date "
"the report is generated as well."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Muddati o'tgan faoliyatlar <unattended_leads_report/past-due>`: "
"natijalarni faqat muddati o'tib ketgan tayinlangan faoliyatga ega lidlar "
"bilan cheklaydi. Buni hisobot yaratilgan sanada bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan "
"faoliyatlarni ham qamrab olish uchun o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:76
msgid ""
":ref:`Unassigned leads <unattended_leads_report/exclude-unassigned>`: "
"excludes leads without an assigned salesperson."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tayinlanmagan lidlar <unattended_leads_report/exclude-unassigned>`: "
"tayinlangan sotuvchisi bo'lmagan lidlarni chiqarib tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Specific sales teams <unattended_leads_report/sales-team>`: limits "
"results to only include leads assigned to one or more sales teams. This "
"filter is optional and should not be included if the report is intended for "
"the entire company."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Muayyan sotuv jamoalari <unattended_leads_report/sales-team>`: "
"natijalarni faqat bir yoki bir nechta sotuv jamoalariga tayinlangan lidlar "
"bilan cheklaydi. Bu filtr ixtiyoriy bo'lib, agar hisobot butun kompaniya "
"uchun mo'ljallangan bo'lsa, uni kiritish kerak emas."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:85
msgid "Add filter for past due activities"
msgstr "Muddati o'tgan faoliyatlar uchun filtr qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:87
msgid ""
"Click the first field for the new rule, and type `Activities` in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search through the list to "
"locate it. Then, next to :guilabel:`Activities`, click the :guilabel:`> "
"(greater than sign)` to open a new drop-down menu with secondary conditions."
msgstr ""
"Yangi qoida uchun birinchi maydonni bosing va :guilabel:`Search...` paneliga "
"`Activities` deb yozing yoki uni topish uchun ro'yxatni aylantirib qidiring. "
"So'ngra, :guilabel:`Activities` yonidagi :guilabel:`> (greater than sign)` "
"belgisini bosib, ikkilamchi shartlarga ega yangi ochiluvchi menyuni oching."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:91
msgid ""
"Type `Due Date` in the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search "
"through the list. Click :guilabel:`Due Date` to add it to the rule."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Search...` paneliga `Due Date` deb yozing yoki ro'yxatni "
"aylantirib qidiring. Uni qoidaga qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Due Date` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:0
msgid ""
"Custom filter pop-up with emphasis on the options for activities and due "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Faoliyatlar va muddat opsiyalari ajratib ko'rsatilgan maxsus filtr qalqib "
"chiquvchi oynasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:98
msgid ""
"Then, click into then next field and select :guilabel:`<=` from the drop-"
"down menu. Selecting this operator includes all activities with a due date "
"up to, and including, the date selected in the next field."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra, keyingi maydonni bosing va ochiluvchi menyudan :guilabel:`<=` ni "
"tanlang. Bu operatorni tanlash keyingi maydonda tanlangan sanagacha bo'lgan "
"va shu sanani o'z ichiga olgan muddatli barcha faoliyatlarni qamrab oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:102
msgid "The third field can be left as today's date, or adjusted as needed."
msgstr ""
"Uchinchi maydonni bugungi sana sifatida qoldirish yoki kerak bo'lganda "
"o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:109
msgid ""
"After filtering for activities, add a :guilabel:`New Rule`. Then, click into "
"the first field for the new rule, and type `Salesperson` in "
"the :guilabel:`Search...` bar, or scroll to search through the list to "
"locate it."
msgstr ""
"Faoliyatlar bo'yicha filtrlashdan so'ng, :guilabel:`New Rule` qo'shing. "
"So'ngra, yangi qoida uchun birinchi maydonni bosing va :guilabel:`Search...` "
"paneliga `Salesperson` deb yozing yoki uni topish uchun ro'yxatni aylantirib "
"qidiring."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:119
msgid "Add a Sales team"
msgstr "Sotuv jamoasini qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:122
msgid ""
"This filter is optional. To view results for the entire company, do **not** "
"add this filter, and continue to :ref:`View results <unattended_leads_report/"
"view-results>`"
msgstr ""
"Bu filtr ixtiyoriy. Butun kompaniya bo'yicha natijalarni ko'rish uchun bu "
"filtrni **qo'shmang** va :ref:`Natijalarni ko'rish <unattended_leads_report/"
"view-results>` bo'limiga o'ting"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:140
msgid ""
"An example of the **Add Custom Filter** pop-up window with all of the rules "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"Barcha qoidalar sozlangan **Add Custom Filter** qalqib chiquvchi oynasining "
"namunasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:156
msgid ""
"After the filters are configured, click :guilabel:`Add`. The resulting "
"report displays all leads assigned to a salesperson where an activity is "
"past due, or is due on the current date. The default display is a bar graph, "
"where the leads are grouped by *stage*."
msgstr ""
"Filtrlar sozlangandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Add` tugmasini bosing. Hosil bo'lgan "
"hisobot faoliyati muddati o'tgan yoki joriy sanada bajarilishi kerak "
"bo'lgan, sotuvchiga tayinlangan barcha lidlarni ko'rsatadi. Standart "
"ko'rinish ustunli grafik bo'lib, unda lidlar *bosqich* bo'yicha guruhlangan."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:160
msgid ""
"To group the results by salesperson, click the :guilabel:`🔻(triangle "
"pointed down)` icon to the right of the :guilabel:`Search...` bar to open "
"the drop-down menu that contains :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"and :guilabel:`Favorites` columns. Under the :guilabel:`Group By` heading, "
"select :guilabel:`Salesperson`."
msgstr ""
"Natijalarni sotuvchi bo'yicha guruhlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Filters`, :guilabel:`Group By` va :guilabel:`Favorites` "
"ustunlarini o'z ichiga olgan ochiluvchi menyuni ochish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Search...` panelining o'ng "
"tomonidagi :guilabel:`🔻(triangle pointed down)` belgisini "
"bosing. :guilabel:`Group By` sarlavhasi ostida :guilabel:`Salesperson` ni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:166
msgid ""
"The option to group by :guilabel:`Sales Team` is also available under "
"the :guilabel:`Group By` heading."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sales Team` bo'yicha guruhlash opsiyasi ham :guilabel:`Group By` "
"sarlavhasi ostida mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:169
msgid ""
"To change to a *list* view, click the :guilabel:`≣ (list)` icon in the top-"
"right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""
"*Ro'yxat* ko'rinishiga o'tish uchun ekranning yuqori o'ng "
"burchagidagi :guilabel:`≣ (list)` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:173
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`(toggle) icon` opens a drop-down menu of additional "
"columns that can be added to the report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`(toggle) icon` ni bosish hisobotga qo'shilishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"qo'shimcha ustunlarning ochiluvchi menyusini ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:176
msgid "Some options that are beneficial for this report include:"
msgstr ""
"Bu hisobot uchun foydali bo'lgan ba'zi opsiyalar quyidagilarni o'z ichiga "
"oladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Activities`: the summary of the latest activity for this lead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Activities`: bu lid uchun eng so'nggi faoliyatning qisqacha "
"mazmuni."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected Closing`: the estimated date on which the lead will be "
"won."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expected Closing`: lid yutib olinishi kutilayotgan taxminiy sana."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:180
msgid ":guilabel:`Probability`: estimated success rate based on the stage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Probability`: bosqichga asoslangan taxminiy muvaffaqiyat darajasi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/unattended_leads_report.rst:187
msgid ":doc:`Activities <../../../essentials/activities>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Faoliyatlar <../../../essentials/activities>`"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:5
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:165
msgid "Point of Sale"
msgstr "Point of Sale"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo **Point of Sale** is designed for managing shops and restaurants. It is "
"web-browser-based, allowing it to run on any device, and is built to "
"maintain functionality even during temporary network outages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **Point of Sale** do'kon va restoranlarni boshqarish uchun "
"mo'ljallangan. U veb-brauzerga asoslangan bo'lib, har qanday qurilmada "
"ishlashi mumkin va vaqtinchalik tarmoq uzilishlari paytida ham ishlash "
"qobiliyatini saqlab qolish uchun yaratilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:11
msgid ""
"Beyond traditional :doc:`store <point_of_sale/shop>` and :doc:`restaurant "
"<point_of_sale/restaurant>` settings, Odoo :abbr:`POS (Point of Sale)` also "
"supports a :doc:`self-ordering <point_of_sale/extra/self_order>` feature, "
"enabling customers to place orders and make payments using a dedicated kiosk "
"or their own mobile device."
msgstr ""
"An'anaviy :doc:`do'kon <point_of_sale/shop>` va :doc:`restoran "
"<point_of_sale/restaurant>` sozlamalaridan tashqari, Odoo :abbr:`POS (Point "
"of Sale)` shuningdek :doc:`o'z-o'ziga buyurtma berish <point_of_sale/extra/"
"self_order>` funksiyasini ham qo'llab-quvvatlaydi, bu mijozlarga maxsus "
"kiosk yoki o'z mobil qurilmalari orqali buyurtma berish va to'lovlarni "
"amalga oshirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:18
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/use.rst:5
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Ish jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:18
msgid "Set up a POS, manage basic settings, and handle daily operations."
msgstr ""
"POS ni sozlang, asosiy sozlamalarni boshqaring va kundalik operatsiyalarni "
"yuriting."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:23
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:3
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant/urban_piper.rst:205
msgid "Products"
msgstr "Mahsulotlar"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:23
msgid "Configure products, categories, combos, and serial number displays."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotlar, kategoriyalar, kombolar va seriya raqamlari ko'rsatilishini "
"sozlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:28
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network.rst:5
msgid "Hardware and network"
msgstr "Uskuna va tarmoq"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:28
msgid "Connect and configure hardware peripherals and network settings."
msgstr "Tashqi uskunalarni ulang va tarmoq sozlamalarini sozlang."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:33
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/shop.rst:5
msgid "Shop features"
msgstr "Do'kon funksiyalari"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:33
msgid ""
"Features specific to retail: manage quotations, \"ship later\" orders, and "
"barcodes."
msgstr ""
"Chakana savdoga xos funksiyalar: takliflar, \"keyinroq jo'natish\" "
"buyurtmalari va shtrix-kodlarni boshqaring."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale.rst:38
#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/restaurant.rst:5
msgid "Restaurant features"
msgstr "Restoran funksiyalari"

