"qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/presets.rst:5
msgid ""
"Presets are preconfigured settings used to quickly apply predefined "
"configurations to POS orders, such as the fiscal position, pricelist, "
"opening hours, order capacity limit, etc. They are particularly useful for "
"businesses that need different configurations depending on the type of sale."
msgstr ""
"Presetlar - bu POS buyurtmalariga fiskal pozitsiya, narxlar ro'yxati, ish "
"vaqti, buyurtma sig'imi chegarasi kabi oldindan belgilangan "
"konfiguratsiyalarni tezda qo'llash uchun ishlatiladigan oldindan sozlangan "
"sozlamalardir. Ular sotuv turiga qarab turli konfiguratsiyalarga muhtoj "
"bo'lgan bizneslar uchun ayniqsa foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/presets.rst:10
msgid ""
"Restaurants can use presets to adjust pricelists and capacities based on the "
"order type, such as :guilabel:`Dine In`, :guilabel:`Takeout`, "
"or :guilabel:`Delivery`."
msgstr ""
"Restoranlar buyurtma turiga qarab, masalan :guilabel:`Dine "
"In`, :guilabel:`Takeout` yoki :guilabel:`Delivery`, narxlar ro'yxatlari va "
"sig'imlarni sozlash uchun presetlardan foydalanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/presets.rst:13
msgid ""
"Flower shops can use presets to apply different taxes when selling flowers "
"and plants (taxed as goods) versus creating arrangements for funerals or "
"weddings (taxed as services). Presets can also help streamline returns and "
"apply different pricelists (with discounts) for loyal customers and/or "
"members."
msgstr ""
"Gul do'konlari gullar va o'simliklarni sotishda (tovar sifatida soliqqa "
"tortiladi) hamda dafn marosimlari yoki to'ylar uchun kompozitsiyalar "
"yaratishda (xizmat sifatida soliqqa tortiladi) turli soliqlarni qo'llash "
"uchun presetlardan foydalanishi mumkin. Presetlar shuningdek qaytarishlarni "
"soddalashtirishga va doimiy mijozlar va/yoki a'zolar uchun turli narxlar "
"ro'yxatlarini (chegirmalar bilan) qo'llashga yordam beradi."

