msgstr ""
"O'rnatilgan :doc:`fiskal lokalizatsiya paketi </applications/finance/"
"fiscal_localizations>`ga qarab, bir nechta fiskal pozitsiyalar allaqachon "
"oldindan sozlangan va POS'da foydalanishga tayyor. Zarur "
"bo'lsa, :ref:`yangilarini yaratishingiz <fiscal_positions/configuration>` "
"ham mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:240
msgid ""
