"(:guilabel:`hamburger menu`) belgisini bosing, so'ngra menyuning pastki "
"qismidagi :guilabel:`Local Network Access` tugmasini bosing. Joriy |LNA| "
"holati tafsilotlari :guilabel:`LNA Permission status` qalqib chiquvchi "
"oynasida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers.rst:5
msgid ""
"Receipt printers integrate with Point of Sale systems to receive print jobs "
"directly from the POS. Once properly configured and connected, this "
"integration enables automatic receipt printing for every completed "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Chek printerlari Point of Sale tizimlari bilan integratsiyalashib, chop "
"etish vazifalarini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri POS dan qabul qiladi. To'g'ri "
"sozlangan va ulangandan so'ng, ushbu integratsiya har bir yakunlangan "
"tranzaksiya uchun chekni avtomatik chop etish imkonini beradi."

